n two or three centuries ago  centuries ago who have killed the  indians  this is not the thing happened in  xinjiang  i apologize i don't really want to go  quite as far back as that answer these  questions then are you forcing weaker  women  to be sterilized of course not  china is a takes a family planning  policy  and we have favorite policy for weaker  minority groups  uh well you know we have to take the  policy  nationwide but for weaker minority  groups  they can give birth to three children  it's much more favorable to compare with  other ethnic groups  and also the accusations against the  chinese government  are totally groundless cases are not the  true facts okay are you separating  uighur children  from their families  no that's not the case we set up the  education and training center especially  for those  who have conducted minor offenses  of radical extremism  and who might be brainwashed by the  extremists and we uh  we take measures in preventative  measures  uh in preventing terrorist attacks  and this policy have proved to be  effective and we have safeguarded their  rights  including the rights to reunite with  their families but human rights  human rights groups uh are saying that  these are concentration camps that's  what the  americans are saying is what the uk is  these are called lies of the century  is what the eu is saying and it's also  what uh  39 countries who have signed a statement  at the un is saying  the pictures you shown your show just  now  actually is a transition of prisoners  from one prison to another it's nothing  to do with  education and training center you know  you have to take preventative measures  and there are no abuses you see  no abuses everybody is in good condition  but we have to take preventative  measures because they are  dangerous prisoners and on the other  hand  in the human rights council meeting just  now there are 70 there are 64 countries  supporting china's policy in xinjiang  including many of t